hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"892","Humein Ismail bin Abi Uwais ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abdur Rahman bin Abi al Zinad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Amr bin Abi Amr se, unhon ne Ikrima se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us shakhs par lanat farmai jo andhe ko raste se bhatka de."
"893","Humein Ismail bin Aban ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abdul Hameed bin Bahram ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Shahr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ibn Abbas ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: ek martaba Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Makkah mein apne ghar ke sehan mein baithe hue the ke achanak aap ke pas se Usman bin Mazun guzre to unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf dekh kar dant nikale to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se farmaya: kya tum nahi baithoge, unhon ne kaha: kyun nahi, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ki taraf rukh kar ke baith gae, phir jab aap un se guftagu farma rahe the ke achanak Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apni nazar aasman ki taraf utha di phir farmaya: abhi abhi jab tum baithe hue the mere pas Allah ka qasid aaya tha, unhon ne kaha: phir unhon ne aap se kya kaha, aap ne farmaya: beshak Allah insaf aur ehsan aur qaraabatdaron ko dene ka hukam deta hai aur behayai aur buri baat aur sarkashi se mana karta hai, woh tumhein nasihat karta hai taake tum yaad rakho, Usman ne kaha: aur wohi waqt tha jab mere dil mein iman jam gaya aur main Muhammad se mohabbat karne laga."
"894","Humein Abdullah bin Abi al Aswad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Muhammad bin Ubaid al Tanafisi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Muhammad bin Abdul Aziz ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Ubaidullah bin Anas se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke aap ne farmaya: jo shakhs do bachiyon ki parwarish kare yahan tak ke woh baligh ho jayen to main aur woh Jannat mein is tarah dakhil honge jaise ye do ungliyan, aur Muhammad ne shahadat ki ungli aur darmiyani ungli se ishara kiya."
"895","Aur do gunah aise hain jin ki saza duniya mein hi jald de di jati hai: zulm o ziyadati aur rishtedari ka todna."
"896","Humein Shihab bin Mamar al Auqi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Hammad bin Salama ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad bin Amr se, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke aap ne farmaya: beshak kareem ibn kareem ibn kareem ibn kareem Yusuf bin Yaqub bin Ishaq bin Ibrahim hain."
"897","Humein Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad bin Amr se, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: qayamat ke din mere dost mutaqqi log honge, agarche koi nasab kisi nasab se zyada qareebi ho, pas log mere pas aamal lekar aayen aur tum duniya ko apni gardanon par lad kar aao phir tum kaho: ae Muhammad, to main yun aur yun kahunga: nahi, aur aap ne apne dono pehluon mein se har ek se munh pher kar dikhaya."
"898","Humein Abdur Rahman bin al Mubarak ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Yahya bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abdul Malik ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Ata ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Abbas se ke unhon ne kaha: main nahi dekhta ke koi is ayat par amal karta hai: ae logo beshak hum ne tumhein ek mard aur ek aurat se paida kiya, yahan tak ke wahan tak pahunche: beshak Allah ke nazdeek tum mein se zyada izzat wala woh hai jo zyada muttaqi hai, phir ek aadmi dusre aadmi se kehta hai: main tujh se zyada izzat wala hun, halanke koi shakhs kisi se zyada izzat wala nahi magar Allah ke taqwe se."
"899","Humein Abu Nuaim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Jafar bin Burqan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Yazeed se ke Ibn Abbas ne kaha: tum karam kise shumar karte ho, halanke Allah ne karam bayan kar diya hai, pas Allah ke nazdeek tum mein se zyada izzat wala woh hai jo tum mein se zyada muttaqi hai, tum hasab kise shumar karte ho, tum mein se hasab mein afzal woh hai jo akhlaq mein tum se behtar hai."
"900","Humein Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Lais ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Amra se, unhon ne Ayesha raziyallahu anha se ke unhon ne kaha: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: roohein jama ki hui faujen hain, phir un mein se jo ek dusre ko pehchanti hain woh manees ho jati hain aur jo ek dusre se anjan rehti hain woh ikhtilaf karti hain."
"901","Humein Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Sulaiman bin Bilal ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se ke unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: roohein jama ki hui faujen hain, phir un mein se jo ek dusre ko pehchanti hain woh manees ho jati hain aur jo ek dusre se anjan rehti hain woh ikhtilaf karti hain."
"902","Humein Yahya bin Saleh al Misri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ishaq bin Yahya al Kalbi se, unhon ne kaha: humein Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman ne khabar di ke Abu Huraira ne kaha: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: ek martaba ek charwaha apni bakriyon mein tha ke bhediya us par jhapat pada aur un mein se ek bakri le gaya to charwahe ne us ka peecha kiya to bhediye ne us ki taraf munh kar ke kaha: darindon wale din is ka kaun malik hoga, is ka mere siwa koi charwaha nahi, to logon ne kaha: Subhanallah, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: pas beshak main is par iman rakhta hun, main aur Abu Bakr aur Umar."
"903","Humein Adam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Shuba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Amash se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Saad bin Ubaida ko bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne Abu Abdur Rahman al Sulami se, unhon ne Ali raziyallahu anhu se ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek janaze mein the to aap ne koi cheez pakad kar us se zameen par kuredna shuru kiya phir farmaya: tum mein se koi shakhs nahi magar us ka aag se thikana aur Jannat se thikana likh diya gaya hai, sahaba ne kaha: ae Allah ke Rasool, to kya hum apne likhe par bharosa kar ke amal chhod na den, aap ne farmaya: amal karo, pas har shakhs us kaam ke liye aasan kar diya jayega jis ke liye woh paida kiya gaya hai, phir farmaya: raha woh jo saadat walon mein se hoga to woh anqareeb saadat wale amal ke liye aasan kar diya jayega, aur raha woh jo badbakhti walon mein se hoga to woh anqareeb badbakhti wale amal ke liye aasan kar diya jayega, phir aap ne tilawat farmai: pas jis ne diya aur taqwa ikhtiyar kiya aur achi baat ki tasdeeq ki."
"904","Muhammad bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Usaid bin Abi Usaid se, unhon ne apni walida se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Qatada se kaha: Aap ko kya hua hai ke aap Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se is tarah hadees bayan nahi karte jis tarah log Aap se bayan karte hain, to Abu Qatada ne kaha: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs mujh par jhoot bole to use chahiye ke apne pehlu ke liye aag me se bistar hamwar kar le, aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ye baat farmate rahe aur apne haath se zameen ko masal rahe the."
"905","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Uqba bin Suhban Azdi ko Abdullah bin Mughaffal Muzani se hadees bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kankari phenkne se mana farmaya, aur farmaya: Beshak wo na shikar ko qatl karta hai aur na dushman ko zakhmi karta hai, lekin beshak wo aankh ko phod deta hai aur daant ko tod deta hai."
"906","Yahya bin Bukair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus se, Ibn Shihab se, Sabit bin Qais se, ke Abu Huraira ne kaha: Makkah ke raste me logon ko tez hawa ne aa liya jabke Umar hajj kar rahe the, pas hawa sakht ho gayi, to Umar ne apne ird gird ke logon se kaha: Ye hawa kya hai, to unhon ne kuch jawab na diya, pas maine apni sawari ko tez daudaya yahan tak ke main un tak pahunch gaya, to maine kaha: Mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke aap ne hawa ke bare me pucha hai, aur beshak maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Hawa Allah ki rahmat me se hai, wo rehmat lekar aati hai aur azaab lekar aati hai, pas use bura na kaho, aur Allah se us ki bhalai mango aur us ke shar se panah mango."
"907","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Salih bin Kaisan se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba bin Masud se, Zaid bin Khalid Juhani se, ke unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hamein Hudaibiya me raat ki barish ke baad subah ki namaz padhai, pas jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz se phire to logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Kya tum jante ho tumhare Rab ne kya farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada janne wale hain, Aap ne farmaya: Mere bandon me se koi mujh par iman lane wala aur koi kufar karne wala ho kar subah karta hai, pas jo kehta hai: Hum par Allah ke fazl aur Us ki rehmat se barish hui, to wo mujh par iman lane wala hai sitare ka munkir hai, aur jo kehta hai: Falan falan sitare ke tulu se barish hui, to wo mera munkir hai sitare par iman lane wala hai."
"908","Makki bin Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hamein khabar di, Ata se, Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab ghata dekhte to andar tashreef late aur bahar tashreef le jate aur aage badhte aur peeche hatte aur Aap ka chehra mutaghayyir ho jata, pas jab aasman se barish barasti to Aap se gham door ho jata, to Aisha ne Aap se is ka zikr kiya, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Aur mujhe kya maloom shayad ye usi tarah ho jaisa Allah azza wa jalla ne farmaya: Phir jab unhon ne use apni wadiyon ki taraf rukh karne wale badal ki surat me dekha."
"909","Abu Nuaim Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Salama bin Kuhail se, Isa bin Asim se, Zirr bin Hubaish se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Badfaali shirk hai, aur hum me se koi is khayal se khali nahi, lekin Allah use tawakkul se door kar deta hai."
"910","Hakam bin Nafi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuaib ne hamein khabar di, yani Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba ne mujhe khabar di, ke Abu Huraira ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Koi badfaali nahi, aur us me se behtar faal hai, logon ne kaha: Faal kya hai, Aap ne farmaya: Nek kalima jo tum me se koi sunta hai."
